      "body": "Wisp upgrade panels now stay open until Mythic rarity, the authoritative Module cap and an owned Ultimate are all complete. Empower and Resonate do not affect completion; unfinished purchases remain visible when currency or prerequisites are missing. Newly visible controls preserve recruitment/Mythic restrictions during affordability refresh, and final purchases keep the same Wisp open and focused.\n\nRegisters focused F04 coverage in the existing default behavioral suite and updates the superseded collapsed-by-default expectation. Purchase handlers, prices/caps, rewards, saves, simulation, package and signing are unchanged. No migration is needed.\n\nValidation: normal focused harness PASS on official Chrome155; 12 mobile profiles (320/390/430px, normal/200% text, normal/reduced motion), 12,912 assertions; F04 plus11 existing scoped scenarios PASS through CDP; source/tooling checks PASS. Required full pre-merge CI is pending. Historical candidate evidence is labelled separately; self-review is not independent review. After green CI, integration, signed APK verification and available native/device checks are part of this task; required unavailable acceptance will remain open.\n\nBaseline: 214d45411ce2fb420f0e4b372063811a967679b1. Task: docs/tasks/WISP_UPGRADE_DISPLAY_001.md. Current evidence: docs/qa/wisp-upgrade-display-001/delivery-2026-10-08/.",
